WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.440
Another winner!

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.560
Your good luck is simply incredible, Captain!

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:41.410
This isn't much; I'm actually holding back.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:46.590
But if there were 10,000 Seina Yamadas, I might decide to get serious...

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:50.350
You're so reliable!

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.300
Ouch!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:07.470
Da Ruma-sama. Seiryo-sama.

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:12.650
I believe it's time we give this ship a formal name...

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.510
Oh, that's right!

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:17.850
Seiryo! You're the captain, you choose a good name for it!

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:21.250
Actually, I already have one in mind, President.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:26.560
I christen the ship V for victory! "Victory" shall be its name!

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.660
Another ship has already taken that name.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:34.630
What? In that case, let's call it "Great Victory".

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.870
That's taken too.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:39.460
Then "Ultra Super Victory"!

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:47.250
--Um...--For me?

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:54.620
If all those other names are taken, then how about plain old "Good Luck"?!

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:59.580
Most people like to give lucky names to their ships, so I don't think...

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:04.660
Aren't there any lucky names left?!

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:09.340
Oh! There is one name left that has "luck" in it.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.470
"Luck", you say?

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.710
Don't tell me it's "Unlucky"...

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:16.740
No, the name looks just fine on paper.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:17.940
It's just that...

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.210
That's not a bad name at all.

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.420
OK, that's it! I'll take it!

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.440
Don't let anyone else get their hands on it!

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.890
A-are you sure...?

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:30.660
What if it gets taken while we're just standing here?!

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:33.330
Register the name immediately!

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.460
Are you really...

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.330
--Do it now! --Yes, sir!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.320
It's been decided! This ship's name is...!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:51.330
The Ship that Brings Luck

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:59.820
Because of the Good Luck Ships, areas of influence have really changed...

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:05.460
Just last week over 1600 transport and insurance companies went under.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:09.170
The price of our transport service's stock has plummeted as well.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:15.040
At this rate, the galaxy's transport industry will come to a grinding halt.

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:20.010
I suppose we really have no other choice but to ask Seina-kun for help...

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:25.770
Fight fire with fire, and good luck with bad luck?

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:31.460
But as the Kamidake is now, victory is a complete impossibility.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.890
There's no time to wait for Fuku-chan to mature, either...

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.000
It looks like we'll have to make it!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.590
The single move that will turn the tables in our favor!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:54.150
What did you want to talk to me about?

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:58.450
What do you say to having a tree selection ceremony?

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.590
Me?! Why?!

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:05.790
Why? You're a member of the Masaki family, are you not?

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.960
But I'm from an offshoot of the family line!

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:13.160
See! I don't have a tree radical in my name!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.370
Amane-chan is a Kaunaq...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.870
Ryoko-chan is a descendent of the Baloutas...

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.970
Neige-chan is a High Priestess...

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:24.980
Of course, your family line doesn't determine the kind of person you are,

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.610
but if you sense even the smallest bit of inferiority to the others,

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:31.420
then having some extra skills isn't bad either, is it?

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:35.090
The emperor of Jurai and the royal family have given their consent as well.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:36.590
But...

00:05:36.590 --> 00:05:39.750
Defeat is unacceptable, is it not?

00:05:43.260 --> 00:05:45.350
Then it's decided!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.140
Tree selection...?

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:54.270
Yes. Royal trees have wills of their own!

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:57.210
The purpose of the ceremony is to become partners with one.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.280
I guess it's a little bit like a formal Japanese marriage interview.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:03.810
Royal trees? Like Seto-sama's ship?

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:09.550
Yes. But I never once imagined I would be having a ceremony!

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:14.220
What're they talking about?!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.160
I can't hear a thing from here!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.070
If only that dirty old hag weren't there!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.470
They have no idea I can hear 'em from here...

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:26.470
What a dirty conversation...!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.070
A directional microphone?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:29.670
Gimme that, you freak!

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:31.840
Oh, Miss!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.880
You're so strong, Mr. Laundry Man!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.580
Oh, Miss!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.020
No, you mustn't! But...!

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:41.090
But Miss...!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:42.320
Hey, what's the big idea?!

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.220
I'm tryin' to do a serious voice-over here...!

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:55.500
Maybe it's just my imagination,

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.940
but this has started feeling kinda good lately...

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:04.080
We did it! We both got appointed to a Good Luck Ship!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:07.680
Yeah! Being suddenly appointed to a flagship is like a dream!

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:10.050
I guess we were just lucky...

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:13.050
What're you talking about? Luck's considered a skill too!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:17.360
We gotta do our best and get luckier and luckier!

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.490
I ain't gonna lose to you!

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:21.010
You wish!

00:07:23.430 --> 00:07:27.890
Welcome, new good luck soldiers!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.980
After the ceremony, there's going to be a large-scale search for it

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:39.680
by member nations of the Galactic Union...?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.080
It's the only one that poses a threat.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.540
But of course the one I'm putting my money on is the Kamidake.

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.920
Will Seina-kun's bad luck triumph?

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:52.910
Or will Tennan-sensei's good luck prevail?

00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:01.270
Seto-sama. It looks like Seina-kun will win.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.460
What was I so worried about?

00:08:11.980 --> 00:08:14.150
We meet again, Seina Yamada!

00:08:14.150 --> 00:08:17.150
Once again, I will defeat you today in your attempt to defeat me!

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:21.420
I've identified them! There's no mistake; it's the Good Luck Fleet!

00:08:21.420 --> 00:08:23.250
Listen to me!

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:26.960
You're gravely mistaken if you think we're keeping that childish name!

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:30.290
Prepare to hear my ship's name and tremble in terror!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:32.230
Hey now! Stop!

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:34.500
You don't need to tell people the ship's name every chance you get!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.770
What are you saying?!

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.570
Didn't you once tell me that it's proper for warriors to state their names?!

00:08:38.570 --> 00:08:41.540
Well, that's true, but... But this is...!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:44.980
Listen! My ship's name means "luck bringer"...!

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:47.380
Unko! (means "luck bringer" or "poop")

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:57.320
What did that moron just say?

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:00.990
I'm sorry, I don't think I heard him right...

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:01.590
Did you?!

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.220
Don't ask me...

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.360
Pass.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:11.840
This ship's captain is Seino-dono, correct?

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.170
This sure brings back memories of my grade school classrooms...

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:20.080
Someone would almost always bring in one stuck on a stick...

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:29.620
What in the world could Seina-chan be thinking of...?

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:33.460
At any rate, let us incinerate and sanitize it immediately,

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:36.390
before it gets a chance to stink up the galaxy!

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.490
The enemy fleet is coming!

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:44.560
Commence attack!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.040
They've opened fire!

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.220
W-what the...?!

00:09:58.220 --> 00:10:00.450
They've connected with the Mikagami?!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:03.750
Who cares! Fire! Fire!

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.760
The link is stable.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:13.130
Just as I thought.

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:17.470
As the same type of ship as Ryo-Ohki, it can easily link with a royal tree.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:20.000
I really must thank Yosho-dono!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.740
Leave the defenses to the Mikagami!

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:23.740
Have the Kamidake concentrate on attacking!

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:25.900
Our goal is to obliterate them!

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.450
Light Hawk Wings?!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.190
Engine output's down!

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:05.750
Retreat! All ships, retreat!

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.320
Follow the Unko!

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:11.190
Damn you! I refuse to lose to you!

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:17.450
You ain't goin' nowhere!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.730
Stay with us, Fuku-chan!

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.030
Seto-sama!

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:28.570
I know. We cannot put her under any more stress.

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:32.280
Cancel the pursuit! This battle has already turned out better than expected!

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:35.450
I'm so sorry. Your wounds aren't even healed yet...

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:39.920
Controlling the Mikagami's power must have been hard on you...

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.820
A link between the Kamidake and a royal tree...

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.620
Now I have the vital data I need...!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:16.520
Hey. Did you tell your parents?

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:17.960
Heck no.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:22.160
What about you, did you tell Marilyn-chan you were appointed to it?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:24.300
We'd be through if I told her...

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.430
--I wish they would...--...re-choose one more time...

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.000
Reselect the crew?

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.110
Yes. All those other ships are a hindrance to me.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:40.210
If we gathered the fleet's luckiest members and put them all on the Unko...

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:44.520
It would become a truly divine mountain of good fortune, President.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:48.990
I see! Begin reselection of the crew at once!

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.520
To the majestic Unko!

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:53.060
To the Unko...

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.180
Unko!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.890
No Good!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.890
Whew!

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:18.060
Gathering Spot for Successful Applicants

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:20.180
Unko!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:27.390
How can he choose a name like that and not be embarrassed?!

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:30.560
His brain's still stuck in kindergarten level or something.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.500
You mean he's always been like that?

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.670
That's why I can't stand him!

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:37.790
Simple-minded people are different from imbeciles, after all.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:56.350
What're you doing, Seina?

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:57.720
Let's go!

00:13:57.720 --> 00:13:59.150
Oh, right!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.330
Welcome, Seina-sama!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.400
You guys got another plan in store, do ya?

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.270
I won't allow you to lay a single finger on Seina-sama!

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.760
Yeah!

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.840
Amane-san!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:26.320
It's good to see ya again, Seina-sama!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.950
I was so lonely without you...!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.220
Oh! I was too, Seina-sama!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:34.590
I fixed you a boxed lunch!

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.360
But what about Amane-san and the others...?

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:43.300
Don't worry, we've prepared something else for them.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.140
U-um...

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:48.070
--This way, Seina-sama! --Hey, wait!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.580
I did it! A perfect low angle shot!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:53.380
NB-sama!

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:55.850
--Wha...?--My name's Nabiko!

00:14:55.850 --> 00:15:00.220
NB-sama! I was created to do intimate things with you!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.990
Why are you running?

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.260
Dunno what's going on, but I hafta get away! I can't let her catch me!

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.990
That's what my instincts tell me!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.790
NB-sama!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.800
They finally let me go...

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.060
I wonder how Kiriko-san is doing...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.780
A tree selecting ceremony, huh...

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.450
Eh?!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:29.780
Seina-sama.

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.250
We gotta climb this...?!

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.120
She really startled me!

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.490
Anyway, I need to find Amane-san and the others...!

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:20.730
Are you alright?!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:25.940
Seina-senpai!

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:26.570
Huh?!

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.340
Read this, please!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.030
Um, wait...

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:37.710
What's with calling me senpai? She looks older than me...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.380
Marriage registration?!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:47.620
Listen!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:51.090
Make sure you're always supporting yourself at 3 different points!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:54.330
Why exactly are we doing this?!

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.900
What in the world's going on?

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.570
Those attendant girls are acting even weirder than usual...

00:17:02.570 --> 00:17:04.910
And I can't find Amane-san and the others either...

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:09.350
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:11.480
How can I ever apologize?!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:14.520
No, it's alright, I'm used to it...

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:18.360
I beg of you! Please don't hate me!

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.390
Uh...

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.860
Whatever shall I do?

00:17:22.860 --> 00:17:24.600
Hello...?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.460
--Stay away!--NB-sama!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.430
Sorry, I really should get...

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.730
Please marry me!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.650
Put your weight into it! Kneel down farther!

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:44.980
This is as far as I can go!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.510
Just do it! Otherwise...

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:56.010
What was up with her?!

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:59.010
Hot Springs

00:17:57.590 --> 00:17:59.010
I've worked up a sweat...

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.140
Men's Hot Spring

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.210
What're you thinking?!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:13.010
Moron! Pervert! Freak! Sicko!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.810
I'm sorry! I didn't know!

00:18:15.810 --> 00:18:18.750
Don't be stupid! Do you think you can get away with just a "sorry"?!

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:21.290
You better take responsibility for this!

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:22.950
Responsibility...?!

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.690
That's right!

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:27.120
Your responsibility for... you know...

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:35.330
You stupid jerk! Even I have to get myself mentally prepared, you know...

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:43.910
This water's great!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:47.640
I never expected there to be an open-air bath here of all places!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.450
The people aren't the only things on Jurai that go against common sense,

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.620
the planet itself does too.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:53.550
You can say that again...

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:10.230
I have a bad feeling about this...

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.160
Seina-sama.

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.870
Where are you going, dear?!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.420
Seina-senpai! You're horrible!

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:27.970
Anytime you want!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:31.290
W-what are those?!

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.720
Don't ask me!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:44.630
I think they might be the kind that likes having other animals around!

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.440
So they're not carnivorous?!

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:50.770
But if they catch us we'll have to do their bidding for the rest of our lives!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:53.310
Hard to tell if that's better or worse...!

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:54.900
They're catching up!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.360
Seina?!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.300
I- I've been dirtied...!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:35.290
We can win! With this, we can win, Captain!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.720
That's right, President!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:41.460
Crammed full of hidden-power stones, jinxes, and amulets,

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:45.800
this is the most powerful Good Luck Ship ever created!

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.770
It truly is a divine gathering!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.630
The divine gathering of Unko!

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:02.700
Oh, my, what terrible-looking faces...

00:21:03.810 --> 00:21:06.450
And whose fault might that be?!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:10.350
They didn't mean you any harm. Forgive them.

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.120
And besides, you weren't bored, were you?

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.260
No, not even for a moment...

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:18.280
Those eyes will shortly pop right back to life!

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.950
From this day forth, she will be Kiriko Masaki Jurai.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.360
How does it sound?

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:48.830
Seto-sama!

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.950
I see. So it has finally shown up.

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:01.510
It has just begun to show up!

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:06.340
The mountain of luck! The divine mountain of Unko!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,keep on doing what you do!

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:32.750
In order to defeat the Good Luck Ship,

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:34.680
we're going to merge Fuku with a royal tree.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:37.420
The Kamidake's core and Kiriko-san's 2nd-generation ship Mizuki

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:38.820
are going to become one now!

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:42.090
But Kiriko-san has become sort of distant...

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:43.900
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:43.900 --> 00:23:45.130
"Introduction- Development- Conclusion"
